<title>USA: US soybean sales to China 50,000 tonnes wk Oct 24.</title>
<headline>US soybean sales to China 50,000 tonnes wk Oct 24.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. soybean sales to China during the week ended Oct 24 totaled 50,000 tonnes, U.S. Agriculture Department said Thursday in its weekly Export Sales Report.</p>
<p>USDA said soybean oil sales to China that week were 14,000 tonnes, but reported reductions in soybean meal sales to China of 54,500 tonnes.</p>
<p>China has so far this marketing year bought 492,800 tonnes of U.S. soybeans, 344,000 tonnes of soybean meal and 34,000 tonnes of soybean oil.</p>
</text>
